  storyId: story_main_02
  storyName: Welcome to the Chaos
  storyDescription: Abstract landscapes, bizarre creatures, and nobody seems concerned.
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 2
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1dfb5eff8c92c56219bc0f921d9b8c4a, type: 2}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Fajar looks around. The environment is strange, filled with abstract
        landscapes and bizarre-looking creatures.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He notices several Concept Spirits behaving in ways he cannot understand.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: One is running away while being chased by several others. Another is
        casually throwing projectiles at someone nearby. Two more are arguing loudly,
        and their argument somehow turns into a bullet hell fight.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Nobody seems particularly concerned about the chaos.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...What?
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A projectile flies past him.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 2
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Okay. Nope.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He turns around and tries to find a way out.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I shouldn't have clicked that button.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He watches another group of Concept Spirits fighting in the distance.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I already understand how vibe coding works, but I didn't expect I'd participate
        in vibe chaos.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: He continues looking for an exit, only to realize that he has absolutely
        no idea where he is or how to get back.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Suddenly, someone approaches him.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
